# Python student project

- Python 3.10+, FastAPI when building APIs, pytest for tests
- Type hints on public functions
- No new dependencies unless the user asks
- Never hardcode secrets, API keys, or passwords; use env var names only
- Match ARCHITECTURE.md when it exists — do not invent extra components
- One feature per change; prefer small diffs
- Routes stay thin; storage and validation in separate functions or classes
